    "sequence": [
      "Define context on a Monthly, Weekly, or Daily chart (identifying the current swing from a discount array to a premium target).",
      "Drop to the designated entry timeframe (e.g., 4H for Monthly context). Wait for price to tap the HTF array.",
      "Wait for the first Fair Value Gap (the 'ST') in the direction of the bias.",
      "Wait for a new short-term range to form that pulls back into an overlapping PD array (FVG overlapping an order block or breaker).",
      "Execute the Original Entry at this overlapping zone.",
      "Move stop to Breakeven when price creates new structure such that there is no logical reason for price to return based on First Line of Defense and Last Line of Defense logic.",
      "Once the Original Entry is at Breakeven or has taken profit, zoom out one timeframe (e.g., Daily for a Monthly context).",
      "Look for a Re-entry Opportunity using the exact same overlapping entry logic."
    ],
    "invalidation": [
      {
        "text": "If a logical reason remains for price to return to your entry based on unmitigated FLOD/LLOD below current price action, do not move to breakeven yet.",
